<!-- The D. Vt. complaint's Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in the face of the typst
     template ({font}, Times New Roman; L.R. 10(a) names none) at 12 pt (size 24 half points, L.R. 10(a)(4)); Body
     Text in exact 24 pt line boxes (typst pitch-double, L.R. 10(a)(6) double spaced) with a half-inch indent; the
     court title, caption, heading and signature lines in 13.8 pt boxes (typst pitch-single); letter page with
     1-inch margins on all sides (L.R. 10(a)(1), (3)) and a centered page number at the bottom (L.R. 10(a)(5)), its
     line 36 pt above the page foot (720 twips: where typst sets it, footer-descent 30 %). docx/vtd-complaint.lua
     writes every paragraph's own spacing. Twips: 20 x pt. -->
